com,"ej,harrv102,P,aheaj901,Interference call"
com,"$Harris called out for running inside the baseline and"
com,"interfering with Susce's throw. In the course of arguing the"
com,"call Harris smacked HP Umpire Ahearn in the face with a mask."
com,"The argument turned into a riot and required the police to"
com,"restore order. Harris was escorted off the field by police."
